<Project>

  <!--
    The version of the package of Godot, in one place.

    A release writes the version of the tag into every file which carries one, and the Godot package carries one in two:
    the project which is packed, and the project of the suite, which names the package it is held to. Written twice they
    can be written apart, and a suite which installs a version of the package other than the one being released is a
    suite which passes for something nobody will be given.

    The projects beside this one - the generator and the weaver - read it as well and do nothing with it: what they are
    is a compiler extension and a program, and neither is published on its own.
  -->

  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>1.0.0</Version>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
